## Self-Heal: Failure Analyst Summary
Root cause: Live-preview init passed `stack` but IInitData requires `stackSdk`; env reads `|| undefined` assigned to required `string` fields host/management_token.
Fix: Use `ContentstackLivePreview.init({ stackSdk: Stack })` — @contentstack/live-preview-utils `IInitData` has property `stackSdk: IStackSdk`, never `stack`. And never write `host: CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST || undefined` into contentstack.Config's `live_preview` object (its `host`/`management_token` fields are `string`, so `string | undefined` fails tsc); instead conditionally spread them exactly like the existing timeout line: `...(CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST ? { host: CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST } : {})` and `...(CONTENTSTACK_MANAGEMENT_TOKEN ? { management_token: CONTENTSTACK_MANAGEMENT_TOKEN } : {})`.
